          <p><span class="label">Fix</span>Parse into <code>toml::Value</code> first, detect the <code>version.workspace = true</code> shape, and resolve via the existing <code>WorkspaceCargoResolver::workspace_version()</code> against the workspace root before falling back to a hard error. Add a regression test with a <code>version.workspace = true</code> member crate.</p>
