ewrites-in-plan.rewrites-order determinism claim falsifiable through an order-sensitive fixture rather than a coincidentally-order-insensitive one, since a naive test (e.g. two rewrites that don't overlap in the fields they touch) would pass regardless of application order and would not actually verify the ordering guarantee."
