    themselves -- this is a coverage-only closure.

    This is NOT a dead-code removal. docs/01-spec.md (SS8, SSC.6, SSG.9.2,
    SSG.10.1) and docs/00-design.md (SS8) specify this feature in detail:
    a separate refs/callisto/pre-cursor/<PackageId> git ref namespace so
